      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/{size}/2018_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-01-25T19:48:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Unforgiving Wasteland has definintely become one of my favorite cards to play with.&nbsp; I've gotten it to eat both Baron Blade and Apostate when they would have otherwise flipped (I was pleased that the Dev Team thought to change the victory screen when you win this way) as well as eating most of The Ennead to keep annoying incaps from bugging me.&nbsp; I haven't tried it against the Chairman yet, but I know what I'll be experimenting with tonight.</p>",
